From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: OrangeFox Builder <builder@localhost>
Date: Mon, 27 Jul 2026 22:10:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] sepolicy: package service contexts in recovery

Keystore2 registers several AIDL services during recovery decryption. Without
the platform service contexts in the recovery variant, servicemanager rejects
the first registration with UNKNOWN_ERROR.
---
 Android.bp | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Android.bp b/Android.bp
index 1b85a64..8c08288 100644
--- a/Android.bp
+++ b/Android.bp
@@ -594,4 +594,5 @@ service_contexts {
     name: "plat_service_contexts",
     srcs: [":service_contexts_files"],
+    recovery_available: true,
 }
